      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7958de86993fdb0b",
      "translationZh": "范数 + 置信度头",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed48390b133366ba",
      "translationZh": "6.4千",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9b3c38247f744e1",
      "translationZh": "总计",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e87686d11bc8eb9a",
      "translationZh": "CPU 和 GPU 上的推理加速",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78cfec2e0e197385",
      "translationZh": "DSpark 针对 LFM2.5-VL-3B 的草稿模型随附 llama.cpp 、 MLX-VLM 和 SGLang 的即日支持。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9001aaa530018651",
      "translationZh": "我们既测量设备端推理也测量 GPU 推理。两种配置均使用 DSpark 块大小 8，并在六种多样化的视觉任务上进行评估，包括通用 VQA、文本 VQA、图像字幕生成、图表 VQA、复杂推理以及多轮对话，遵循 MMSpec 基准。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2152c596e9d24bae",
      "translationZh": "设备端推理。在 M5 Max 上使用 MLX，解码速度按任务提升 2.30x 到 3.13x。端到端延迟降低 1.56x 到 2.62x。在 M3 Ultra 上使用 llama.cpp，解码提升 1.57x 到 2.14x，端到端提升 1.30x 到 1.77x。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb1f77c1ddcaa048",
      "translationZh": "GPU 推理。在 H100 上，相同的 drafter 可实现 20.4 倍至 2.66 倍更快的解码，端到端提升为 1.64 倍至 2.27 倍。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "223169946fc59a0c",
      "translationZh": "视觉工作负载中猜测的局限性",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3bf5d2ce382c13f",
      "translationZh": "在 LLMs 中，prefill 主要受计算限制，其成本随提示长度呈（次）二次方增长。VLMs 在此基础上增加开销，因为图像首先通过视觉编码器，然后语言骨干处理数百个视觉 token 以及文本提示。边缘设备的计算能力远低于数据中心 GPU，因此 prefill 占据了更多的端到端延迟，这一点在 Apple silicon 和 H100 上的首 token 时间和解码测量中可见。（M5 的每核 GPU 神经加速器缩小了这一差距）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e9a2d2c1522e30e",
      "translationZh": "猜测解码仅提升解码阶段，而不提升视觉编码或 prefill。当这些阶段已经占据了大部分墙钟时间时，即使解码速度提升很大，也只能带来 modest 的端到端收益。这正是 Amdahl 定律，即整体加速受未被加速的工作负载部分的限制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d2d820952255d9ee",
      "translationZh": "如何使用 LFM2.5-VL-DSpark",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e4bd51d01cf1d58",
      "translationZh": "在 SGLang 中运行 DSpark draft 模型需要一个带有 DSpark 支持的 SGLang 构建，以适用于 LFM2 目标（PR #40651）。启动目标时附带 draft：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d533dc0f586aa6a",
      "translationZh": "然后查询位于 http://localhost:30000/v1 的 OpenAI 兼容端点。块大小从 draft 的 config.json 中读取；基线是不带三个 --speculative-* 标志的相同命令。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd32b709ed6dbf1a",
      "translationZh": "使用 llama.cpp 运行它们需要相应的 llama.cpp 构建（PR#29339）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a19d19205b03f29",
      "translationZh": "使用 MLX-VLM 运行它们需要相应的构建（PR#2280）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9641be9bdf6470ab",
      "translationZh": "块大小从 sidecar 元数据中读取（n-max 被限制在该值内）。投机解码是精确的：目标会验证每个提议的 token，因此贪婪输出等同于仅目标本身；每次响应的时间报告 draft_n / draft_n_accepted。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "983f311018642b0a",
      "translationZh": "开始使用",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4607bebdbc913ae9",
      "translationZh": "我们的 Vision DSpark 草稿模型已在 Hugging Face 上以 Safetensors 和 GGUF 格式提供。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1741dd85bd7b04d9",
      "translationZh": "使用 LFM2.5，我们正在实现随处运行的 AI 愿景。这些模型包括：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "34277a1b95576fbc",
      "translationZh": "开放权重 — 下载、微调并在没有限制的情况下部署。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "feebf9b41a17f54f",
      "translationZh": "从第一天起即快速 — 对 llama.cpp、MLX 和 SGLang 提供开箱即用的支持。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ab3d455e9ae086d",
      "translationZh": "完整的系列 — 从用于定制的基础模型到专用的音频和视觉变体，一个架构覆盖多种使用场景。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1bbe1ca9743e7ac1",
      "translationZh": "我们迫不及待想看到你会构建什么。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2955789aa4f8eb36",
      "translationZh": "引用",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
